Scoped colorchannelmixer video filter

The option table (rr..aa, pc, pa), pix_fmts, the 8-bit lookup tables of
config_output (lut[i][j][v] = lrint(v * gain)), the rgba_map byte offsets and
the pc=none paths of filter_slice_rgba_packed_8 and filter_slice_rgba_planar_8
(four table entries summed and clipped with av_clip_uintp2) in
src/video-ops/colorchannelmixer.ts follow libavfilter/vf_colorchannelmixer.c
(colorchannelmixer_options, pix_fmts, config_output, filter_frame,
process_command) and libavfilter/colorchannelmixer_template.c.
Fixed FFmpeg commit:946fcce07b6dcd0331c8cc609192aeff5e1924f8
